    question: "What is the best tattoo studio software?",
    answer: "The best tattoo software depends on your studio, but the key question is whether a platform is built for tattooing or adapted from generic salon booking. MyTattoo.Software is purpose-built for tattoo studios — it handles reference image uploads, multi-hour sessions, and tattoo-specific deposit policies out of the box. Booksy, Mindbody, and Square Appointments are capable general booking tools, but you bolt tattoo-specific workflows on yourself.",
    links: [
      { text: 'Tattoo studio software guide', url: '/tattoo-studio-software/' },
      { text: 'See pricing', url: '/pricing/' }
